  "sourceTitle": "Pasta With Garlic and Eggs",
  "sourceText": "Pasta With Garlic and Eggs\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Wednesday, March 24, 2010 - 1:26am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1/2 pound Dry pasta\n2 Eggs, beaten\n1/2 cup Olive oil\n4 Cloves of garlic\n2 teaspoons Parmesan cheese\n1 Salt and pepper, taste\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Cook pasta. Heat the oil in small frying pan, add garlic. Saute for just a moment. Drain pasta, toss all ingredients together. Salt and pepper to taste.",
